  "body": "Full-audit stability fix prompted by bot 10 / Samsung Galaxy S25 FE listing 10034864145.\n\nThe negotiation check could navigate directly to a conversation, land on Vinted `/session-refresh`, and immediately validate the refresh URL as if it were the conversation URL. That caused the conversation check to fail before acceptance/counteroffer processing.\n\nThis change exposes the existing bounded/retrying MarketplaceNavigator path for arbitrary trusted Vinted URLs and routes four production flows through it:\n- existing negotiation conversation inspection;\n- next-step negotiation preparation/send;\n- first-offer item navigation;\n- live listing target verification.\n\nThe shared navigator keeps cookies/storage intact, waits up to the existing session-refresh timeout, retries boundedly, rejects non-Vinted targets, and does not alter negotiation prices/decisions, quota, session files or submit semantics.\n\nRegression coverage reproduces the UUID S25 FE conversation URL through `/session-refresh` and verifies recovery without touching stored session state.",
